WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.570
An army marched into a country fifty times smaller than itself, and the snow swallowed it.

2
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:12.740
White shadows gliding through the forest on skis cut columns of tanks kilometres long into pieces and froze them where they stood.

3
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:19.430
Finland lost that war — but in Berlin the wrong lesson was drawn, and that lesson cost millions of lives.

4
